 4 bedrooms and hot tub. Large yard with parking for 20 vehicles. 12 Beds can sleep up to 20 people. Rated one of the best rentals in Manitoba.... The Buffalo Point peninsula is Mother Nature’s post card where gentle prairie meets the Canadian Shield and sandy","photo":"https://www.travelmanitoba.com/imager/assets_simpleviewinc_com/simpleview/image/upload/crm/manitoba/Arbutus_9AD70CD8-A786-46B7-B1A430D2D5508295_92264167-596a-4794-877dafe6a2c0f386_cd380920256f1a1fd1e5a27fa86626e4.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":5}]},{"name":"Rickers Campground","desc":"This vast region of Manitoba provides refuge to an abundance of wildlife. But for those who seek a deeper connection, you’ll find the land holds the stories of Indigenous peoples, where communities shine with the legends of the past and of the future. Manitoba South East's landscapes and its people are equally diverse - find Indigenous, French, Icelandic and Mennonite communities. 53'16.557'N 99'24.224'W, Grand Rapids MB Grand Rapids, MB R0C 1E0 1.5 km east on Highway 23 at junction of 23 & 18 at Ninette NINETTE, MB R0K","photo":"https://www.travelmanitoba.com/imager/s3_us-west-1_amazonaws_com/manitoba-2020/images/06-site-images/hero-images/camping_cd380920256f1a1fd1e5a27fa86626e4.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":6}]},{"name":"Yummiest Salsa Competition","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.travelmanitoba.com/imager/s3_us-west-1_amazonaws_com/manitoba-2020/images/salsa_6b1b90bccd1e04db55551ed6286b789d.png","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":7}]},{"name":"Winnipeg Graffiti Boat Tour","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.travelmanitoba.com/imager/s3_us-west-1_amazonaws_com/manitoba-2020/images/last-chance-poster-small_6b1b90bccd1e04db55551ed6286b789d.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":8}]},{"name":"Tasting","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.travelmanitoba.com/imager/s3_us-west-1_amazonaws_com/manitoba-2020/images/Apple-harv